{
  "name": "@fish-under-sea/dsh-fish",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "description": "Fish 自建 DSH 插件全家桶聚合包：一键插入本人自建插件与常用外部补充插件的插件行（approval-guide / git-sync / settings-nav-order / visual-companion / skill-lens-fish + agent-teams / better-reasoning-effort / our-free-model）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
